<div style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6B6B80;padding-top:8px;">Expires in 15 minutes &middot; single use</div>
</td></tr>
