</table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px 32px 0;">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6B6B80;margin-bottom:8px;">You&#39;re receiving this because a password reset was requested for the Nexdo account at this address.</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6B6B80;margin-bottom:8px;">If you didn&#39;t request this, you can ignore this email. Your password will not change.</p>
