exports[`transactional email template > renders the verify email email with code, expiry and logo > text 1`] = `
"Welcome to NexDo!

Less on your mind, more done in your day.

Your personal AI-powered productivity assistant is almost ready.

Verify your email

Use this code to finish creating your NexDo account.

Your code is 042917.
Expires in 24 hours · single use

Top 10 Ways NexDo Makes Life Easier

1. Smart To-Do’s: Capture, organize and get things done with AI.

2. Calendar & Reminders: Plan your day and never miss a thing.

3. Shopping Lists: Create lists, find nearby stores and even send them.

4. Moments: Capture special memories, notes and milestones.

5. Calorie Tracker: Log meals easily and stay on track with your goals.

6. Pomodoro Focus: Stay focused and be more productive.

7. AI Assistant: Just ask to create tasks, plan, find answers and more.

8. Find Nearby: Discover nearby stores, services and places.

9. Share & Collaborate: Share lists and plans with family and friends.

10. Sync Across Devices: Access everything on all your devices, anytime.

Open NexDo App (App Store): https://apps.apple.com/us/app/nexdo-ai-planner/id6812225981

If you didn't request this email, you can ignore it.

Questions? support@nexdo.test
"
`;
